me she reaches for you, instead of enjoying the moment, you're thinking about whether your body will cooperate.<br><br>What used to feel natural now comes with pressure.<br><br>You miss being spontaneous. <br><br>You miss feeling confident. <br><br>You miss being able to enjoy intimacy without worrying about your performance.<br><br>Because deep down, you don't just want better sex. You want to feel like yourself again.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="sc-ktJcvw lknomy pf-54_ pf-r pf-c-cm pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:8px;--s-sm:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:5"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-gtJxSR cOjBdh pf-55_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-eIceNc cJLiOo pf-56_ pf-heading-1-h3 pf-lg-hide pf-md-hide pf-sm-hide"><strong>#2. More Energy Won't Fix Everything That's Draining You</strong></h3><img alt="ChatGPT Image Aug 29, 2026, 07_34_15 PM.png__PID:1b8d0e7d-6569-40c7-9c30-2fea7a89ea00" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/ChatGPT_Image_Sep_17_2026_11_35_33_PM.png?v=1789702544&width=2048" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/ChatGPT_Image_Sep_17_2026_11_35_33_PM.png?v=1789702544&width=375 375w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/ChatGPT_Image_Sep_17_2026_11_35_33_PM.png?v=1789702544&width=550 550w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/ChatGPT_Image_Sep_17_2026_11_35_33_PM.png?v=1789702544&width=768 768w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/ChatGPT_Image_Sep_17_2026_11_35_33_PM.png?v=1789702544&width=1024 1024w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/ChatGPT_Image_Sep_17_2026_11_35_33_PM.png?v=1789702544&width=1280 1280w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/ChatGPT_Image_Sep_17_2026_11_35_33_PM.png?v=1789702544&width=1440 1440w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/ChatGPT_Image_Sep_17_2026_11_35_33_PM.png?v=1789702544&width=1680 1680